      "content": "I'm starting a new podcast called \"The Reality Check.\" The vibe is very \"common sense,\" straight-talking, and a bit anti-establishment. I want to call out people in power who are out of touch with regular people. Can you write a short 2-minute opening monologue for the first episode where I'm just setting the tone and explaining why this podcast needs to exist?",
